WEBVTT

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.696
and the pickup truck
they drive around the farm,

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:34.136
that is made from parts
from all over the world.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:38.256
In fact, the US exports steel to Colombia.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:43.256
So I went to Indiana,
and I thanked the steel makers.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:46.416
And it just drove home

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:50.016
that it doesn't take a village
to make a cup of coffee.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.176
It takes the world
to make a cup of coffee.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:58.296
And this global economy,
this globalization,

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.136
it does have downsides.